error_signature: "explicit qualification required to use member .* from dependent base class"
root_cause: "C++ 模板两阶段名字查找：派生类模板中访问【依赖基类】的成员时，非限定名不会在实例化时查找基类作用域（clang/GCC 现代标准模式）。2000 年代的 C++ 代码（如 maq 0.7.1 stdhash.hh）在旧 GCC 默认宽松模式下可编译，换 clang 15 / C++17 报 error 而非 warning。"
rec_approach: "最小修改：在派生类模板内对该基类成员调用加 `this->` 限定（或 `Base<keytype_t>::member`）。不要用 -fpermissive / -Wno- 类开关绕过。"
rec_command: "sed -i 's/\\bdirect_insert_aux(/this->direct_insert_aux(/g' <header>   # 逐处核对后使用"
match_keywords: ["explicit qualification required", "dependent base class", "two-phase lookup", "this->", "clang", "template", "stdhash.hh"]
error_excerpt: "./stdhash.hh:415:13: error: explicit qualification required to use member 'direct_insert_aux' from dependent base class"
severity: P1
category: cpp
last_updated: 2026-09-30
source_event: "maq/0.7.1 适配（mapcheck.o 编译失败 → this-> 限定 3 处）"
